<p style="font-size:clamp(18px,2.4vw,24px);max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.4;text-wrap:pretty;text-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(10,20,38,.85),0 0 16px rgba(10,20,38,.7)">Bringing epic foam battles to you.</p>
</div>
</section>
