<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty;">Foam War Parties is a family dream founded by Joshua English, inspired by his son Michael and his love of foam blasters.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty;">We're building something that brings safe, active fun to neighborhoods, with a long-term vision of opening a permanent foam battle facility in Branson, Missouri.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty;">We focus on safe, exciting events where families and friends can laugh, compete, and make memories together.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty;font-weight:800;color:#0875D1">Foam War Parties — Bringing Epic Foam Battles to You!</p>
